    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist game about restoring nature\u2019s balance in an overgrown forest</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop Down Trees</strong> \u2013 Clear the overgrowth and shape the environment around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/f5c559b04fae811472726f37039f6a61.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/f5c559b04fae811472726f37039f6a61.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/f5c559b04fae811472726f37039f6a61.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Sell Wood</strong> \u2013 Collect resources to trade for better tools and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/bb0435f63afee32ba5c1314c53d5cb01.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/bb0435f63afee32ba5c1314c53d5cb01.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/bb0435f63afee32ba5c1314c53d5cb01.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Axe</strong> \u2013 Start with basic tools and work your way up to more powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/e3255824a44123c5cb49bd116f510e5b.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/e3255824a44123c5cb49bd116f510e5b.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/e3255824a44123c5cb49bd116f510e5b.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Stamina</strong> \u2013 Pace yourself to avoid overexertion and injury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/5b7a9c8a1a2afd0e87800968a0e51e4a.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/5b7a9c8a1a2afd0e87800968a0e51e4a.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/5b7a9c8a1a2afd0e87800968a0e51e4a.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Secrets</strong> \u2013 As you cut deeper into the wilderness or the ruins, uncover the mysteries buried beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/7683e8e7da740b21f81cbbae220d9ca6.poster.avif?t=1755251385\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/7683e8e7da740b21f81cbbae220d9ca6.webm?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/7683e8e7da740b21f81cbbae220d9ca6.mp4?t=1755251385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p></li></ul>",
